  OK, wanderer2 screens 13, 16, 17, 18, and 20 are impossible as distributed,
whether due to noise during transmission (e.g. the " in the lower right corner
of level 20), flat impossible by any explanation (e.g. the gems on level 17
completely surrounded by '!' and the wall, with no teleportation to them), or
due to just possible insufficient testing (e.g. the holding pattern the 'S's
get into on level 18, reminiscent of wanderer 1 level 13).

